    "title": "Budget-three 4-cycle bi-Mobius transversal",
    "status": "PROVED",
    "closure": "proof",
    "statement": "Every B*=3 4-cycle witness defines a rational map A_1/A_0 with complete fibers on T_0,T_1 and injective Mobius graph fibers on T_2,T_3. The Plucker identity gives their exact graph difference. Every further A_0,A_1 pencil member has at most six domain roots, so for d>=8 the pencil has exactly two fully domain-split degree-(d-1) members. The resulting primitive bi-Mobius map is not excluded.",
